            "review_title": "Review at Guem Bbq Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Maria A\n1 contribution\n0\nGood !\nJul 2026 • Family\nWe had a nice experience at Hu Em BBQ. The service was fast, and the staff were very friendly and attentive. The presentation of the dishes was interesting and made the meal more enjoyable. The meat was good, but the portions were quite small. Compared to other restaurants in Da Nang, the prices are on the higher side. Overall, it’s a good place to try if you’re looking for Korean BBQ and don’t mind paying a bit more.\nRead more\nWritten July 25, 2026",
