            "review_text": "Luke N\n3 contributions\n0\nDamn good eats in Da Nang\nJan 2026 • Friends\nFrom the moment the front door to the establishment swung open, till the final moment-this was a night to be happy! The service was spot on, as was the fresh array of food. My friend and I appreciated all the hospitality and after a long day of >80 km riding our bikes nothing was left uneaten or under appreciated. I am new to SE Asia and after 6 days this was a standout among standouts for excellence. - go! Enjoy! \nYour will be happy\nYour Welcome\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 21, 2026",
