            "review_title": "Review at Guem Bbq Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Alexander V\nTurnhout, Belgium4 contributions\n0\nMeat is back on the menu boys\nNov 2025 • Friends\nRight, the korean bbq thing was new to me, I tought to give myself a crash ourse. We started with the cow menu, which I can heathily recommend. And then got convinced to try the wagyu menu. I regret nothing. Excellent presentation and serving speed. By the time a side is emptied its alreay filled again. Even if bbq is not your thing try this, its better then a steak dinner by miles. Unless you're a vegetarian there is no reason not to. (Also the hostesses are very cute)\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nNot the cheapest, worth it though\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 25, 2025",
